# Security and Risk

- HIGH_RISK paths need an approved plan before writes.
- The Agent must not run destructive git, filesystem, database, terraform destroy, broad kubectl deletes, or publish commands.
- The Agent must not install or change dependencies unless the approved plan says so.
- The Agent must not run `approve-plan`, `approve-stage`, or `deploy-qa`.
- This plugin is local agent governance. It does not replace branch protection, PR review, CI, IAM, or production access control.
